  ["The Faction relay buttons in the Synchronization panel and the Players tab now show a green dot while Faction relay is on or managed in the Companion, and their tooltip says which."] = "The Faction relay buttons in the Synchronization panel and the Players tab now show a green dot while Faction relay is on or managed in the Companion, and their tooltip says which.",
  ["Matchmaking is now called Faction relay, to say what it is for: sharing war data between Alliance and Horde."] = "Matchmaking is now called Faction relay, to say what it is for: sharing war data between Alliance and Horde.",
  ["The Companion tooltip in the Synchronization panel is shorter and says it syncs your map with the cloud while the game is closed."] = "The Companion tooltip in the Synchronization panel is shorter and says it syncs your map with the cloud while the game is closed.",
  ["The Companion synchronizes again after the latest game update."] = "The Companion synchronizes again after the latest game update.",
  ["After the latest game update, the Players tab again shows the region of every listed player and the ruleset of players from your own realm, and of other realms once Warfront has learned them, and some war news that stopped arriving arrives again."] = "After the latest game update, the Players tab again shows the region of every listed player and the ruleset of players from your own realm, and of other realms once Warfront has learned them, and some war news that stopped arriving arrives again.",
  ["The War Camps of both continents in the War Balance now have the same size."] = "The War Camps of both continents in the War Balance now have the same size.",
  ["Normal and PvP realms no longer mix their war maps."] = "Normal and PvP realms no longer mix their war maps.",
  ["A welcome window opens on your very first login with Warfront: your first steps, Matchmaking, your connection and the optional Companion. /wf welcome shows it again."] = "A welcome window opens on your very first login with Warfront: your first steps, Matchmaking, your connection and the optional Companion. /wf welcome shows it again.",
  ["A chat line now shows the Warfront name and version at login."] = "A chat line now shows the Warfront name and version at login.",
  ["While the Warfront Companion is not in use, a \"Get the Companion\" button on the Territory tab and a \"Download\" button in the Synchronization panel open its Windows and Mac download links, ready to copy."] = "While the Warfront Companion is not in use, a \"Get the Companion\" button on the Territory tab and a \"Download\" button in the Synchronization panel open its Windows and Mac download links, ready to copy.",
  ["During a siege, the animated catapult now also appears beside the besieged Settlement or Capital icon on its zone map."] = "During a siege, the animated catapult now also appears beside the besieged Settlement or Capital icon on its zone map.",
  ["The Army tab now shows how many of each unit you have on the bottom-right corner of its portrait, instead of after its name."] = "The Army tab now shows how many of each unit you have on the bottom-right corner of its portrait, instead of after its name.",
  ["The Matchmaking button in the Synchronization panel and the one in the Players tab now have a short tooltip."] = "The Matchmaking button in the Synchronization panel and the one in the Players tab now have a short tooltip.",
  ["The Players tab now shows a faction emblem before each player's name and their region and realm type (such as \"EU PvP\") when the game can tell."] = "The Players tab now shows a faction emblem before each player's name and their region and realm type (such as \"EU PvP\") when the game can tell.",
  ["Faction capitals on the continent map's campaign route and in the War Balance now show the capital crown instead of the faction emblem."] = "Faction capitals on the continent map's campaign route and in the War Balance now show the capital crown instead of the faction emblem.",
  ["In the War Balance, once the attackers hold the first stop, the start of each front's line fades out and the stops move left to fill the space."] = "In the War Balance, once the attackers hold the first stop, the start of each front's line fades out and the stops move left to fill the space.",
  ["Selecting Warfront in the AddOns options now shows the general options directly instead of an empty page."] = "Selecting Warfront in the AddOns options now shows the general options directly instead of an empty page.",
  ["Capture alerts now name the place type (\"Outpost captured\", \"War Camp lost\", \"Settlement captured\", \"Capital lost\"...) instead of \"Territory captured\" or \"Territory lost\", and the Journal entry starts with the same title."] = "Capture alerts now name the place type (\"Outpost captured\", \"War Camp lost\", \"Settlement captured\", \"Capital lost\"...) instead of \"Territory captured\" or \"Territory lost\", and the Journal entry starts with the same title.",
  ["Map markers and routes now update at once when switching between the world, continent and zone maps."] = "Map markers and routes now update at once when switching between the world, continent and zone maps.",
  ["The Matchmaking invitation windows now grow to fit their text in every language, so it never overlaps the buttons."] = "The Matchmaking invitation windows now grow to fit their text in every language, so it never overlaps the buttons.",
  ["The Yes/No confirmations for garrison pledges and army launches now show on a dark, gold-framed bar, so their text is easy to read."] = "The Yes/No confirmations for garrison pledges and army launches now show on a dark, gold-framed bar, so their text is easy to read.",
  ["In the Garrison tab, +1 and +5 now add up: pick several units and resources, then confirm once to give them all. Your picks show as icons in the confirmation bar and as green \"+N\" on the garrison, capture time, units and War Chest, and what you keep shows on each portrait and resource icon."] = "In the Garrison tab, +1 and +5 now add up: pick several units and resources, then confirm once to give them all. Your picks show as icons in the confirmation bar and as green \"+N\" on the garrison, capture time, units and War Chest, and what you keep shows on each portrait and resource icon.",
  ["The siege catapult on a besieged capital now animates on the continent map instead of staying still."] = "The siege catapult on a besieged capital now animates on the continent map instead of staying still.",
  ["In the War Balance, when both factions face each other between two stops, their arrows now sit side by side instead of on top of each other."] = "In the War Balance, when both factions face each other between two stops, their arrows now sit side by side instead of on top of each other.",
  ["Map areas on a square minimap now fill it to the corners instead of being cut to a circle."] = "Map areas on a square minimap now fill it to the corners instead of being cut to a circle.",
  ["First public release of Warfront."] = "First public release of Warfront.",
